/**
 * Applies the standard product discount to new OpportunityLineItems whose
 * Discount field is still null.  Discount rules are owned by PricingRules;
 * this handler only orchestrates the batch lookup so we stay within
 * governor limits even for large CPQ quotes (200+ lines).
